1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:05,309
It is worth saying plainly what the last three years actually contained, because speed blinds.

2
00:00:05,309 --> 00:00:13,427
A fifteen-year-old announced as a label's future, then removed from the biggest launch of her company's decade for reasons she never controlled.

3
00:00:13,427 --> 00:00:17,822
Four months of public silence at an age when most careers haven't started.

4
00:00:17,822 --> 00:00:22,989
A return under the heaviest comparison nickname the internet could manufacture.

5
00:00:22,989 --> 00:00:34,175
And then — instead of the cautious, managed mediocrity that usually follows a health pause — a run of records, covers, charts, and domes executed at full sprint.

